      "message": "This is the implementation if real live scenario:\n\nhttps://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/zephyr/drivers/fingerprint/fingerprint_fpc1025.c;l\u003d372?q\u003dplatform%2Fec%20fingerprint_fpc1025.c\u0026ss\u003dchromiumos%2Fchromiumos%2Fcodesearch#:~:text\u003d371-,372,-373\n\nFirst, we try to convert the type\n\n```\n\trc \u003d convert_fp_capture_type_to_fpc_capture_type(capture_type);\n\n\tif (rc \u003c 0) {\n\t\tLOG_ERR(\"Unsupported capture_type %d provided\", capture_type);\n\t\treturn rc;\n\t}\n```\n\nSecond, the internal acquire image can a negative value\n```\n\trc \u003d fp_sensor_acquire_image_with_mode(image_buf, rc);\n\tif (rc \u003c 0) {\n\t\tLOG_ERR(\"Failed to acquire image with capture_type %d: %d\",\n\t\t\tcapture_type, rc);\n\t\treturn rc;\n\t}\n```\n\nI believe the implemented here is slightly different but captures what is available in the device tree, which should mimic `\trc \u003d convert_fp_capture_type_to_fpc_capture_type(capture_type);`",
